      // (--hud-leaderboard-bg / --hud-chat-bg / --hud-minimap-bg), all fully opaque
      // (alpha 1) with the game's own backdrop. An opaque inner background hides any
      // backdrop blur set on Murther's wrapper, so a blur above 0 also repoints the
      // game's own vars at a translucent background plus the slider's px. Written
      // later in the head with !important, it beats the game's stylesheet and its
      // unprioritised JS-driven writes; at 0 nothing is emitted (game look kept).
