    mxDesc(fcRow, 'Caps the whole page’s frame rate by admitting or skipping entire vsyncs — the game loop, HUD loops and the menu canvas throttle together, so the cap holds while you play. "Uncap FPS" removes the client limiter AND the engine’s own Ticker throttle (the hidden ceiling that made uncapped look like 60) and touches nothing else — Reduce effects stays exactly as you set it. The remaining ceiling is your monitor’s refresh. Toggles live, no reload needed.');
